## Remember

```text id="p2k8vr"
FAB
 ↓
Floating main action

Scaffold
 ↓
floatingActionButton:

onPressed
 ↓
action

child
 ↓
icon/content
```

**FAB = a prominent floating action button, usually for the screen's main action.**
